{"slug":"/components/installation","title":"Installation — Getting Started — Planes","desc":"How to install dependencies and structure your app — Pro Planes components with your license key, free components from the public registry.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-16\"><article class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl\"><header class=\"border-b border-border/60 pb-8\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Installation</h1><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-secondary p-1.5\"><div class=\"relative inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy Page\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-l-md pl-2.5 pr-2 text-[13px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring sm:pl-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:flex\" style=\"width:auto\"><span class=\"invisible absolute\">Copy Page</span><span class=\"invisible absolute\">Copied</span><span class=\"flex\">Cop<span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">y</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\"> </span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">P</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">a</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">g</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">e</span></span></span></button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sr-only\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-px bg-border/70\"></span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open in an AI assistant\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-r-md px-1.5 text-foreground/60 transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-3.5 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-secondary p-1.5\"><a aria-label=\"Previous page: Introduction\" class=\"inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/components/introduction\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg></a><a aria-label=\"Next page: MCP\" class=\"inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/components/mcp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-lg text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">How to install dependencies and structure your app.</p></header><div class=\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-border/60 py-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:py-8 sm:[&amp;&gt;*]:py-10 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-6 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:pb-0\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border/70 px-5 py-4\"><span class=\"mt-1 shrink-0 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground/50\">Note</span><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Pro components install through an authenticated registry — a one-time setup per project. Free components install exactly like<!-- --> <a href=\"https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4\">shadcn/ui</a>.</p></div></div><section id=\"create-project\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-24 gap-5 sm:gap-8\"><span class=\"pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums leading-6 text-muted-foreground/50\">01</span><div cla